<title>NETHERLANDS: Daifuku seals Dutch Vanderlande takeover.</title>
<headline>Daifuku seals Dutch Vanderlande takeover.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch Vanderlande Industries BV said on Friday it had reached full agreement on the gradual transfer of all its shares to Japan's Daifuku Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Daifuku said in November it planned to gradually buy the Dutch unlisted company for more than 10 billion yen.</p>
<p>Vanderlande produces material handling systems, automation and distribution systems for airports and warehouses.</p>
<p>The company will continue to operate worldwide as an independent unit. Its present management will also be given the responsibility for all Daifuku activities in Europe, which will be integrated within Vanderlande, it said.</p>
